      <activity id="c7a1621b-2268-52b1-a3e0-976a55d2e231" activityNameId="2416eff6-fc13-553e-97fd-644dd2ad1079" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ventilation system, Bürogebäude Verenastrasse, Baden, special comp.</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ventilation system, Bürogebäude Verenastrasse, Baden, special comp.
Disposal of special components of a ventilation system for an office building with offices, kitchen, restaurant and car park. The inventory is based on a building with a total heated gross floor area of 7492 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 42500 m3/h, total weight of the components: 2379 kg/Unit, building with a specific air flow rate of 5.7 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. Data from call of bid including components for commercial kitchen with exhaust and supply air ceiling system mainly made of stainless steel and aluminium. Stainless steel exhaust air hood for kitchen. No ducts included.;
UUID: 52074243-da42-4480-8837-45545d48da53
Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals.
Location: Specific to the technology mix encountered in sorting plants in Switzerland.
Technology: Disposal to a sorting plant assumed. Metal pieces, copper in cables and electronic devices are recycled, plastic parts are incinerated, inert wastes (e.g. rock wool) are landfilled.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013. Disposal technology mix as used in late 1990ies
Production volume: na
Sampling: Waste-specific calculation based on production input data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_52074243-da42-4480-8837-45545d48da53.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
